      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/krobia-xinguensis-2/",
      "html": "<p>This pretty cichlid was scientifically described only in 2012. Until then it was known among hobbyists as Krobia sp. “Xingu Red Head”. A relative of Aequidens, it is an ideal cichlid species for beginners, because it is one of the most peaceful cichlids of all. The fish also have beautiful colours and stay small, under 10 cm, which makes them dwarf cichlids.</p>"
    },
